      "id": "AzureDevOpsMcp",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "Notice: This platform-specific package is now deprecated.\n\nTo provide a better developer experience and leverage .NET 10's cross-platform capabilities, we have unified all platforms into a single, architecture-neutral package.\n\nPlease migrate to the main package: AzureDevOpsMcp\n\nThe new unified package supports Windows, macOS (x64/Arm64), and Linux with a single installation command:\n\ndotnet tool install -g AzureDevOpsMcp",
    "reasons": [
      "Other"
    ]
  },
